    "New token": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新生成 token"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No camera available. Enter the pairing details manually.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有可用的相机，请手动输入配对信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No device has reported yet. Paired iPhones and Watches send their logs on every refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有设备上报。已配对的 iPhone 和手表每次刷新时会发送日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No key stored. Environment variables also work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未保存密钥。也可以用环境变量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to show yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notify me when a window crosses a threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口用量越过阈值时通知我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: Claude Code rotates its own tokens; a second refresher can sign it out. Opening Claude Code refreshes the token for both.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭：Claude Code 会自行轮换 token，第二个刷新者可能把它踢下线。打开一次 Claude Code 就能同时刷新两边的 token。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: QuotaPulse is a menu-bar-only app (find it top right, or search QuotaPulse in Spotlight). On: a Dock icon that reopens this window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关：QuotaPulse 只在菜单栏（右上角，或在 Spotlight 搜 QuotaPulse）。开：显示 Dock 图标，点击重新打开此窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open QuotaPulse on the Mac → Hub & Devices, then scan the QR code or type the address and token below. Data travels directly between your devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上打开 QuotaPulse → Hub 与设备，然后扫描二维码，或在下方填写地址和 token。数据只在你的设备之间直接传输。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open QuotaPulse…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 QuotaPulse…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the provider's usage dashboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
