    "Push to Apple Watch now": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "立即推送到 Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit QuotaPulse": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出 QuotaPulse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QuotaPulse lives in the menu bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QuotaPulse 住在菜单栏里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QuotaPulse never sees your provider credentials on this device — only the numbers your Mac publishes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QuotaPulse 在这台设备上不会接触任何供应商凭据——只读取你的 Mac 发布的数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QuotaPulse reads the credentials your CLIs already keep on this Mac and never sends them anywhere except the provider itself. Logs: `log stream --predicate 'subsystem == \"app.lishuyu.quotapulse\"'`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QuotaPulse 读取你的 CLI 已保存在这台 Mac 上的凭据，除供应商本身外不会发送到任何地方。日志：`log stream --predicate 'subsystem == \"app.lishuyu.quotapulse\"'`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Range": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "范围"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reachable from other devices (Tailscale / LAN)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许其他设备访问（Tailscale / 局域网）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read from Claude Code (Keychain “Claude Code-credentials”, then ~/.claude/.credentials.json). Nothing is stored by QuotaPulse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 Claude Code 读取（先钥匙串“Claude Code-credentials”，再 ~/.claude/.credentials.json）。QuotaPulse 不保存任何凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read from ~/.codex/auth.json (or $CODEX_HOME). Expired sessions are refreshed with the Codex CLI's own client id and written back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从 ~/.codex/auth.json（或 $CODEX_HOME）读取。过期会话会用 Codex CLI 自己的 client id 刷新并写回。"
          }
